                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2">School Bag</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Durable, high-capacity backpack built for everyday school usage and book storage.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Item 2 -->
                <div class="group bg-gray-50 hover:bg-blue-50/50 border border-gray-100 hover:border-blue-200 transition-all duration-300 p-8 rounded-2xl text-center shadow-sm hover:shadow-md">
                    <div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-6 bg-blue-100 text-primary rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-3xl group-hover:scale-110 transition duration-300">
                        👟
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2">School Shoes</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Comfortable, long-lasting footwear designed for school uniform compliance.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Item 3 -->
                <div class="group bg-gray-50 hover:bg-blue-50/50 border border-gray-100 hover:border-blue-200 transition-all duration-300 p-8 rounded-2xl text-center shadow-sm hover:shadow-md">
                    <div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-6 bg-blue-100 text-primary rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-3xl group-hover:scale-110 transition duration-300">
                        📚
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2">School Books</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Essential exercise books and notebooks required for the upcoming academic term.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Item 4 -->
                <div class="group bg-gray-50 hover:bg-blue-50/50 border border-gray-100 hover:border-blue-200 transition-all duration-300 p-8 rounded-2xl text-center shadow-sm hover:shadow-md">
                    <div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-6 bg-blue-100 text-primary rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-3xl group-hover:scale-110 transition duration-300">
                        ✏️
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2">Pencil Box</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Includes pens, pencils, erasers, sharpeners, rulers, and geometry basics.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Item 5 -->
                <div class="group bg-gray-50 hover:bg-blue-50/50 border border-gray-100 hover:border-blue-200 transition-all duration-300 p-8 rounded-2xl text-center shadow-sm hover:shadow-md">
                    <div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-6 bg-blue-100 text-primary rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-3xl group-hover:scale-110 transition duration-300">
                        👕
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2">School Uniform</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Standard regulation uniform material sets tailored for student comfort.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Item 6 -->
                <div class="group bg-gray-50 hover:bg-blue-50/50 border border-gray-100 hover:border-blue-200 transition-all duration-300 p-8 rounded-2xl text-center shadow-sm hover:shadow-md">
